OL,3,GNEWSACouncils publishing housing lists 
OL,4,A'could increase danger for migrants',  
OL,5,Asays campaigner                        
OL,7,FA decision by two councils to publish  
OL,8,Fdetails about houses of multiple       
OL,9,Foccupation (HMOs) online could increase
OL,10,Fdanger to migrants, a campaigner has   
OL,11,Fsaid.                                  
OL,13,FPublic lists of HMOs across Northern   
OL,14,FIreland were removed after riots in    
OL,15,FJune that saw some of those properties,
OL,16,Fand migrant families housed in them,   
OL,17,Ftargeted for violence.                 
