OL,3,GNEWSACouncils publishing housing lists 
OL,4,A'could increase danger for migrants',  
OL,5,Asays campaigner                        
OL,7,FLisburn and Castlereagh City Council   
OL,8,Fand Ards and North Down Borough Council
OL,9,Fhave voted to publish details of HMOs  
OL,10,Fin those council areas. Several other  
OL,11,Fcouncils are due to discuss their own  
OL,12,Flists in the coming days.              
OL,14,FSupt Joanne Gibson said that police had
OL,15,Fwarned Lisburn and Castlereagh         
OL,16,Fcouncillors that publicising the data  
OL,17,F"may lead to targeted activity against 
OL,18,Foccupants".                            
